-- The song comes from [DND] L70ETC FX Controller (23830): when it spawns it plays sound 11803
-- after 9.4 s, fires the lightning, earthquake and rain of fire effects, and despawns itself
-- after 275 s; it then respawns after its spawn time (was 120 s) and the show starts again.
-- Now the controller drives the band: 1 s after every spawn it sends data 1 to the five members within
