-- its old out-of-combat rows, counted from the controller's spawn). The 89344 casts ("Armor" in
-- 8.3.7) are again "remove Greater Invisibility"; Thunder-Skins' separate on-spawn drum list is
-- dropped (it would cut his show list off). The controller now respawns 30 s after the song
-- ends, so the break is about 50 s. Replaces 2026_11_06_09's loop. Safe to run more than once.

